ethercat (1.6.13) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sync official stable-1.6 through 1.6.13 (drivers, FoE/EoE hardening,
    datagram re-order barriers, max-frame split).
  * Keep our parallel slave scan/config, AL recovery and DC patches.

 -- mika <mika-net@outlook.com>  Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:40:00 -0400

ethercat (1.6.9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Parallel slave configuration (multi-slave bus reaches OP in seconds).
  * SDO information API and bus rescan in the realtime library.
  * Numerous stability fixes (datagram index reuse, external-ring timing,
    mailbox state machines, SDO dictionary gating, DC sync1 shift).
  * SII timing relaxed for slow EEPROMs.
  * New ethercat diag command, slave port bypass detection and upstream
    port inference.
  * FoE password support.

 -- mika <mika-net@outlook.com>  Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
